# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/terraform.tfvars
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Datos y binarios
**/*.csv
**/*.zip
**/*.log
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*.pyc
**/__pycache__/
**/.cache/

# Variables de entorno (secretos)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets/

# Archivos grandes (BTS)
**/bts_flights*.csv
**/test_*.csv

# Configuraciones locales
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Comprimidos
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz

# Estado de Terraform (contiene info sensible)
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup

# Excepcion: resultados de perfilamiento son evidencia de entrega
!docs/sprint1/data-assessment/results/
!docs/sprint1/data-assessment/results/*.csv
!docs/sprint1/data-assessment/results/*.json
